Endpoint描述:
api/v1/model/make-id/{make}/{year}
Get model by make id and year
sample:

Get up to 10 phone images (IDs).
Use these IDs in the Endpoint: Get {Image} by {Phone Image id}
The image IDs expire after 30 minutes.

